# Optional API base override (include /api). When unset, Kloppy chooses a
# local API on port 8001 during development and https://kloppy-dd2u.onrender.com/api
# in production. For a custom deployment, set this to its API URL and allow
# this frontend origin in the backend's FRONTEND_ORIGINS setting. Production
# health-checks configured URLs and falls back to the hosted API if one is down.
VITE_API_URL=
